Package: gxde-dlna-caster
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 ffmpeg
Description: Cast your desktop screen and audio to DLNA TVs
 GXDE DLNA Caster (GXDE投屏工具) casts the Linux desktop screen,
 desktop audio, or local media files to DLNA/UPnP media renderers
 such as Android TVs and set-top boxes.
 .
 Features: automatic LAN device discovery, screen + audio capture,
 local file casting, adjustable bitrate/fps, and local preview.
